---
title: Warm Zucchini Ribbons with Lemon, Feta, and Walnuts
author: Alton Brown
source: Alton Brown Cooks Food
url: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=to1y94oMZ5Q&t=730s
servings: 4
prep time: 15 minutes
cook time: 8 minutes
time required: 23 minutes
course: salad, light main
cuisine: Mediterranean
diet: vegetarian
tags:
  - zucchini
  - feta
  - walnuts
